          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "A Mishap"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.124,
            0.847,
            0.2
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "？ "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Example 13:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " After Surbhi bought cookware from the wholesaler, she kept a profit margin of 50% on all the products. To clear off the remaining stock, she thought she would offer a 50% discount and come out without any loss."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.204,
            0.584,
            0.224
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(i) Do you think she didn’t make any loss?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.158,
            0.227,
            0.846,
            0.266
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(ii) If she had sold goods (originally) for ₹12,000 after discount, how much loss did she incur? What is the percentage loss?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.27,
            0.847,
            0.325
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(iii) What should have been the percentage discount offered so that she sold the goods at the price she had bought (i.e., no profit or loss)?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.332,
            0.459,
            0.351
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Let us model the situation first."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.351,
            0.538,
            0.389
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Suppose the worth of the products she bought from the wholesaler is x."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.389,
            0.538,
            0.425
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The worth corresponding to the selling price (with a 50% margin) is 1.5x."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.424,
            0.538,
            0.462
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "make the worth 0.75x."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.552,
            0.322,
            0.927,
            0.461
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 10,
              "bbox": [
                0.552,
                0.322,
                0.927,
                0.461
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_26_image_10.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.156,
            0.472,
            0.847,
            0.512
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(i) This means the selling price is "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 3 } { 4 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " of the price the goods were bought at, i.e., a 25% loss."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.515,
            0.556,
            0.536
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(ii) If she had sold goods worth ₹12,000,"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.427,
            0.539,
            0.571,
            0.56
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_26_equation_13.jpg",
          "content": "0.75x = 12,000"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.444,
            0.569,
            0.553,
            0.59
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_26_equation_14.jpg",
          "content": "x = 16, 000."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.199,
            0.594,
            0.347,
            0.612
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "She lost ₹4000."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.617,
            0.836,
            0.638
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(iii) To sell the goods at the same price, the discount offered should be"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.406,
            0.642,
            0.594,
            0.661
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_26_equation_17.jpg",
          "content": "1.5x - d \\times (1.5x) = x"
